otherwise I would never been able to write

1142
00:42:43.920 --> 00:42:45.720
my book style off focus, right?

1143
00:42:45.720 --> 00:42:48.730
So and there's loads of things like that we can do

1144
00:42:48.730 --> 00:42:49.990
in terms of changing what we eat,

1145
