00:43:29.500 --> 00:43:32.005
it kind of dovetails into a conversation

1165
00:43:32.005 --> 00:43:33.780
around flow as well.

1166
00:43:33.780 --> 00:43:36.750
Which is the antithesis of this distracted state

1167
00:43:36.750 --> 00:43:41.750
of multitasking and as a parent of teenagers I can tell you.

