1473
00:55:11.620 --> 00:55:13.730
into literally thousands of products.

1474
00:55:13.730 --> 00:55:17.781
And every year the number of like new chemicals

1475
00:55:17.781 --> 00:55:19.414
that find their way into these product...

1476
00:55:19.414 --> 00:55:21.200
I mean, I don't know what the numbers are but it's insane.

1477
00:55:21.200 --> 00:55:24.890
No, of all the causes that I write about

1478
00:55:24.890 --> 00:55:27.490
in Stolen Focus, all the 12 causes.

1479
00:55:27.490 --> 00:55:28.790
This is the one that most shocked me

1480
00:55:28.790 --> 00:55:31.060
