1483
00:55:36.020 --> 00:55:37.150
Why?

1484
00:55:37.150 --> 00:55:38.910
This might be the single biggest reason

1485
00:55:38.910 --> 00:55:41.460
why they realize we struggled to focus.

1486
00:55:41.460 --> 00:55:42.680
Professor Barbara (indistinct),

1487
00:55:42.680 --> 00:55:44.720
who's one of the leading scientists in France.

1488
00:55:44.720 --> 00:55:45.630
She's won of the Legion of Honor,

1489
00:55:45.630 --> 00:55:48.127
