1490
00:55:48.127 --> 00:55:50.660
"It's not possible to have a normal brain today

1491
00:55:50.660 --> 00:55:52.090
because of the level of the pollutants

1492
00:55:52.090 --> 00:55:53.710
that we're exposed to."

1493
00:55:53.710 --> 00:55:54.790
And there's lots of these.

1494
00:55:54.790 --> 00:55:56.110
So there's another professor,

1495
00:55:56.110 --> 00:55:58.700
a brilliant professor called Barbara Maher in Britain

1496
00:55:58.700 --> 00:56:00.870
at the University of Lancaster who's done all this research.

1497
00:56:00.870 --> 00:56:01.873
Think about air pollution, right?

1498
00:56:01.873 --> 00:56:04.673
Very conscious of this air in Los Angeles.

1499
00:56:06.825 --> 00:56:08.760
So if you live in any major cities

1500
00:56:08.760 --> 00:56:09.857
particularly (indistinct),

1501
00:56:11.340 --> 00:56:14.320
you are breathing in air pollution that contains iron.

1502
00:56:14.320 --> 00:56:16.090
And when you breathe it in the iron goes straight

1503
00:56:16.090 --> 00:56:16.923
to your brain, right?

1504
00:56:16.923 --> 00:56:19.940
And there's nothing in human evolution that prepared us

1505
00:56:19.940 --> 00:56:21.110
for inhaling iron.

1506
00:56:21.110 --> 00:56:23.290
It's just no precedent for it.

1507
00:56:23.290 --> 00:56:26.750
And what happens when you breathe in iron

1508
00:56:26.750 --> 00:56:28.720
is it causes what Professor Maher calls,

1509
00:56:28.720 --> 00:56:30.990
a repeated chronic insult to the brain.

1510
00:56:30.990 --> 00:56:32.640
It causes brain inflammation.

1511
00:56:32.640 --> 00:56:34.520
There's research from all over the world now.

1512
00:56:34.520 --> 00:56:37.440
from places like Mexico City, Barcelona,

1513
00:56:37.440 --> 00:56:39.660
about the really harmful effects of (indistinct).

1514
00:56:39.660 --> 00:56:41.147
One study in Mexico City studied

1515
00:56:41.147 --> 00:56:44.360
kids who lived in polluted areas and kids who didn't,

1516
00:56:44.360 --> 00:56:45.260
