1517
00:56:45.260 --> 00:56:47.280
And the kids who lived in heavily polluted areas

1518
00:56:47.280 --> 00:56:50.720
had already had plaques and tangles like dementia patients

1519
00:56:50.720 --> 00:56:51.620
in their brains, right?

1520
00:56:51.620 --> 00:56:53.670
This is a huge effect.

1521
00:56:53.670 --> 00:56:56.070
And you're absolutely right about the way

1522
00:56:56.070 --> 00:56:57.040
