1535
00:57:21.660 --> 00:57:22.493
And you're right,

1536
00:57:22.493 --> 00:57:24.863
Professor Bruce Lanphear, he's a great guy at UBC,

1537
00:57:24.863 --> 00:57:26.970
University of British Columbia,

1538
00:57:26.970 --> 00:57:29.020
