00:57:32.710 --> 00:57:35.220
People should go to his website, littlethingsmatter.

1541
00:57:35.220 --> 00:57:36.903
Think its littlethingsmatter.ca,

1542
00:57:37.920 --> 00:57:39.310
where they're doing fantastic work.

1543
00:57:39.310 --> 00:57:40.370
'Cause you are totally right.

