00:57:56.070 --> 00:57:59.410
But the FDA do lots of checks to make sure

1553
00:57:59.410 --> 00:58:02.050
that it's not gonna poison or harm people.

1554
00:58:02.050 --> 00:58:03.160
And then it gets released.

