00:58:03.160 --> 00:58:04.570
So what Professor Lanphear argues,

1556
00:58:04.570 --> 00:58:06.942
I think completely rightly is that we need to have

1557
00:58:06.942 --> 00:58:09.710
an equivalent to the FDA for industrial pollutants

1558
00:58:09.710 --> 00:58:10.850
and chemicals, right?

1559
00:58:10.850 --> 00:58:11.870
And we need to test the stuff

1560
00:58:11.870 --> 00:58:12.980
that's already being used

1561
00:58:12.980 --> 00:58:13.813
'cause there...

1562
00:58:13.813 --> 00:58:17.470
I mean, there's a chemical that's on most ring pull cans

1563
00:58:17.470 --> 00:58:20.533
that when monkeys are exposed to that profoundly damages

1564
00:58:20.533 --> 00:58:22.940
their working memory, their ability to do

1565
00:58:22.940 --> 00:58:24.830
the equivalent of monkey attention.

1566
00:58:24.830 --> 00:58:26.530
I mean, there's a loads of chemicals

1567
00:58:26.530 --> 00:58:29.860
that we are being exposed to that in tests on other animals,

1568
00:58:29.860 --> 00:58:32.440
non-human animals show profound harm.

1569
00:58:32.440 --> 00:58:34.660
Now we don't test these things on human children

1570
00:58:34.660 --> 00:58:37.000
for very good reasons and I'm in favor of that.

1571
00:58:37.000 --> 00:58:40.830
But you can see how we really need to deal with this.

1572
00:58:40.830 --> 00:58:41.663
This is urgent.

1573
00:58:41.663 --> 00:58:45.290
Yeah, it is crazy that it isn't properly regulated.

1574
00:58:45.290 --> 00:58:48.600
Crazy, well, and it's because we have a political system

1575
00:58:48.600 --> 00:58:51.963
that is owned by corrupt interests, right?

1576
00:58:53.750 --> 00:58:55.371
So we need to reclaim the political system

1577
00:58:55.371 --> 00:58:56.410
to democratize that.

1578
00:58:56.410 --> 00:59:01.410
Which is why I'm sympathetic to Bill Maher's dystopian.

1579
00:59:03.287 --> 00:59:04.120
(chuckles)

1580
00:59:04.120 --> 00:59:08.190
Pessimistic view on all of this because the powers that be,

1581
00:59:08.190 --> 00:59:11.700
these large corporations which include Facebook, Google,

1582
00:59:11.700 --> 00:59:16.700
the like carry so much influence

1583
00:59:17.110 --> 00:59:19.850
