3422
02:07:07.940 --> 02:07:09.750
When you're sleeping, you're repairing.

3423
02:07:09.750 --> 02:07:11.265
Let your brain repair.

3424
02:07:11.265 --> 02:07:13.592
Massively prioritize sleep.

3425
02:07:13.592 --> 02:07:14.425
There's a...

3426
02:07:14.425 --> 02:07:17.170
Dr. Czeisler told me a really interesting piece of research

3427
02:07:17.170 --> 02:07:18.580
