3434
02:07:30.610 --> 02:07:33.209
And you can see the obvious reason in evolution.

3435
02:07:33.209 --> 02:07:36.430
You're out, it gets dark you get a surge of energy.

3436
02:07:36.430 --> 02:07:38.132
You'll be able to get back to your cave better

3437
02:07:38.132 --> 02:07:39.160
