3449
02:08:01.450 --> 02:08:02.720
He needs to get back to his cave.

3450
02:08:02.720 --> 02:08:04.260
Your body doesn't know you're already in your cave,

3451
02:08:04.260 --> 02:08:05.830
you're in your bed, right?

3452
02:08:05.830 --> 02:08:09.130
So really restrict the amount of artificial light

3453
02:08:09.130 --> 02:08:12.210
