3454
02:08:12.210 --> 02:08:14.090
And the way I discipline myself to do that

3455
02:08:14.090 --> 02:08:15.260
is I put my phone kSafe,

3456
02:08:15.260 --> 02:08:16.900
sorry to (indistinct) on about this.

